only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $9{x}^{2}=(3x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=3x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u=\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{1-9{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{1-(3x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\,\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{1-{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{artanh}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{artanh}⁡3x+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this result is subject to the condition $|3x|<1.$" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364822 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364823 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364824 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364825 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364826 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1041 "selection" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364825 13194139535752 true] [17592186364821 1110 #uuid "029b2f45-bd43-55bf-b8dd-3185e603ad55" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364822 1034 "\\operatorname{artanh}⁡(\\frac{x}{3})+C" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364822 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535752 true] [17592186364822 1111 #uuid "eef343b1-105f-5162-8a40-15409cd4083e" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364823 1034 "3\\operatorname{artanh}⁡9x+C" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364823 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535752 true] [17592186364823 1111 #uuid "bf0bceb5-7701-56a9-8aff-1e53a7c45008" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364824 1034 "\\operatorname{artanh}⁡9x+C" 13194139535752 true] [17592186364824 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535752 true] [17592186364824 1111 #uuid "25ae96